expect: pickat 98,208: id 31574 shape  269 frame  16 at 17759,18184,56 flags 0000 q 0 npc 0 map 37 parent 0 family 6 [s] pad 2x2x5
expect: pickat 100,222: id 31574 shape  269 frame  16 at 17759,18184,56 flags 0000 q 0 npc 0 map 37 parent 0 family 6 [s] pad 2x2x5
